hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"205","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Hammad bin Masada told us, Abdullah bin Omar told us. H. Abu Hashim Ziyad bin Ayyub, Ahmad bin Mani’, and Ma’mal bin Hisham told us, they said: Ismail informed us, Ziyad said. And Ahmad said: Ayoub informed us, and Ma’mal said: On the authority of Ayoub. H Imran bin Musa, the name of Abdul-Warith, told us on the authority of Ayoub. H Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, that Malik told him, all of them, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, he said: “ I saw men and women performing ablution at the time of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, from one vessel.” The meanings of their hadiths are the same, and this is the hadith of Ibn Ulayya."
